<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23.38 pct, 3-mo 23.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23.38 pct, 3-mo 23.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) fell by 0.01 percentage point for the one-month and by 0.02 points for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The BUBOR was fixed by the NBH at 23.38 percent for the one month and 23.25 for the three month maturity.</p>
<p>The NBH began calculating BUBOR on August 1.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
